			</Frame>
			<!-- The quest icons (2026-10-19, after FCJH_QTest steps 1-19, docs/blizzard-fixes.md): a
			     copy of Blizzard's Tab panel, whose quest icons fill their tooltips without Tab, cut
			     down to just those icons. Its box (HeroLeaderPanelContainer, the one place the mouse
			     answers it) is our pane; each of its rows sits on our row of the same number
			     (FCJH_TalentRow0-9), its first quest icon on our quest cell (FCJH_QuestCell0-9), the
			     icon's chain Unclipped. Everything else at Alpha 0 and deaf to the mouse. Under our
			     talents (500), over the skin (400): our talents take the mouse first, the cells pass
			     it through. Blizzard's icon whole (68, its picture 40 at a 14 inset - our cell), so
			     its quest ring shows (user, 2026-10-16); no background, its talent border only when
			     the hero has a quest (FCJH_QuestBorder). Try 4 parked a copy off the screen and
			     lifted the icons onto us: an icon can't leave its row and keep a tooltip (QTest
			     steps 3-10), so here the rows come too. -->
			<Frame type="HeroLeaderPanel" name="FCJH_QuestPanel" template="HeroLeaderPanel/HeroLeaderPanelTemplate">
